OL,5,G0232 Tech Life
OL,6,     FWhat is a good age to give a child
OL,7,     Fa smartphone? A community in
OL,8,     FIreland might have the answer. In
OL,9,     FGreystones there's a voluntary
OL,10,     Fagreement to wait until secondary
OL,11,     Fschool age.
